# The manifest variables whose values are secrets, and where an installation
# keeps each one: VARIABLE NAMESPACE/SECRET/KEY.
#
# Three readers. The installer records every other variable it rendered with,
# and never one listed here. Flui never reads back the body of a file whose
# template names one of these. And a refresh that finds a Secret missing on an
# older installation creates it by copying the key from another place the same
# variable is listed — never from a value it was given.
#
# A variable may be listed more than once; the first line is where the
# installer writes it first. Lines beginning with # are comments.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD flui-system/flui-secrets/DB_PASSWORD
REDIS_PASSWORD flui-system/flui-secrets/REDIS_PASSWORD
ENCRYPTION_KEY flui-system/flui-secrets/ENCRYPTION_KEY
SSH_KEY_ENCRYPTION_KEY flui-system/flui-secrets/SSH_KEY_ENCRYPTION_KEY
GRAFANA_PASSWORD flui-system/flui-secrets/GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD
GRAFANA_PASSWORD flui-control/grafana-admin/password
JWT_SECRET flui-system/flui-secrets/JWT_SECRET
ALERTS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN flui-system/flui-secrets/ALERTS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN
ALERTS_WEBHOOK_TOKEN flui-control/alertmanager-webhook/token
ADMIN_PASSWORD flui-system/flui-secrets/ADMIN_PASSWORD
FLUI_CLI_API_KEY flui-system/flui-secrets/FLUI_CLI_API_KEY
PROVIDER_HETZNER_API_KEY flui-system/flui-secrets/PROVIDER_HETZNER_API_KEY
PROVIDER_SCALEWAY_ACCESS_KEY flui-system/flui-secrets/PROVIDER_SCALEWAY_ACCESS_KEY
PROVIDER_SCALEWAY_SECRET_KEY flui-system/flui-secrets/PROVIDER_SCALEWAY_SECRET_KEY
K3S_TOKEN flui-system/flui-secrets/K3S_TOKEN
SSH_CA_PRIVATE_KEY_B64 flui-system/flui-secrets/SSH_CA_PRIVATE_KEY
ZITADEL_MASTERKEY flui-system/zitadel-secrets/masterkey
ZITADEL_DB_ADMIN_PASSWORD flui-system/zitadel-secrets/db-admin-password
ZITADEL_DB_USER_PASSWORD flui-system/zitadel-secrets/db-user-password
ZITADEL_ADMIN_TEMP_PASSWORD flui-system/zitadel-secrets/admin-temp-password
